graph TD
    User[User Client] -->|HTTPS| Gateway[Rust GeoShield Gateway]
    
    subgraph Rust Gateway
        Auth[Auth Middleware]
        Headers[Security Headers]
        RL[Rate Limit Middleware]
        Audit[Audit Log Middleware]
        Proxy[Proxy Handler]
        
        Gateway --> Auth
        Auth -->|Valid| Headers
        Headers --> RL
        RL -->|Allowed| Audit
        Audit --> Proxy
    end
    
    Proxy -->|/api/v1| API[FastAPI Backend]
    Proxy -->|/app| Frappe[ERPNext]
    Proxy -->|/| Frontend[Vite PWA]
    
    API --> PostGIS[(PostgreSQL/PostGIS)]
    
    Auth -.->|Verify| Keycloak[Keycloak IDP]
